	<meta property="og:description" content="Idaho Bureau of Homeland Security News Release For immediate release, June 8, 2010 Contact:  (primary) Robert Feeley, (208) 859-6943 or (secondary) Col. Tim Marsano (208) 407-8838 Idaho Counties under State Disaster Declaration Due to Flooding &nbsp; (Boise)  Due to severe weather and flooding conditions in central Idaho, State Senate President Pro Tem and Acting Governor [&hellip;]" />
